      "title": "MySQL Server should enforce TLS/SSL minimum version",
      "resource": "azurerm_mysql_server.changeme_simple_mysql_server",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "explanation": "The resource enables SSL enforcement but does not specify a minimum TLS version. Without `ssl_minimal_tls_version_enforced`, the server may accept older, vulnerable protocols like TLS 1.0 or 1.1."
    },
    {
      "check_id": "CKV_AZURE_110",
      "title": "MySQL Server should have Geo-Redundant Backup enabled",
      "resource": "azurerm_mysql_server.changeme_simple_mysql_server",
      "severity": "LOW",
      "explanation": "The configuration lacks explicit backup retention settings. Enabling geo-redundant backups and setting an appropriate retention period ensures data durability and compliance with disaster recovery best practices."
    }
  ],
  "patched_code": "resource \"azurerm_mysql_server\" \"changeme_simple_mysql_server\" {\n  name                = \"changeme-simple-mysql-database-name\"\n  resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.changeme_simple_mysql_server_resource_group.name\n  location            = azurerm_resource_group.changeme_simple_mysql_server_resource_group.location\n  storage_mb = \"5120\"\n  sku_name   = \"B_Gen5_1\"\n  version    = \"8.0\"\n  administrator_login          = \"changemeadmin\"\n  administrator_login_password = \"ch4ng3m3-A@Â£$%^&\"\n  ssl_enforcement_enabled = true\n  ssl_minimal_tls_version_enforced = \"TLS1_2\"\n  create_mode = \"Default\"\n  backup_retention_days = 7\n  geo_redundant_backup_enabled = true\n}",
  "fix_summary": "Added `ssl_minimal_tls_version_enforced` set to 'TLS1_2' to prevent weak protocol usage. Added `backup_retention_days` and `geo_redundant_backup_enabled` to ensure data protection and disaster recovery capabilities."
